WEBVTT

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.080
At last...

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.420
At last, I've become Numero Uno!

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.510
O-Ouch...

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.830
Wait, not good, not good!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.300
Pretty pathetic of you to get swallowed up by the Egogy you were trying to swallow.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.690
Mammo!

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:22.810
Ira!

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.170
Save me, please!

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:27.140
We can't! It's too late!

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.020
That is unmistakably him!

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.330
The one whose immense power once conquered this very universe!

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:53.800
The dark monster that even Cure Empress's Precures failed to eliminate!

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.070
Indeed.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.430
I am the Proto-Selfish.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:03.050
And I have finally reawakened after ten thousand years!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.820
I shall once again enshroud the world in darkness

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:10.560
and rule over all life as I see fit!

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:14.120
We'll never, <i>ever</i> let you!

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.030
As long as we're here,

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.790
You shall not do as you please!

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.760
As long as breath yet remains in our bodies,

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.400
We'll fight with every ounce of strength we have!

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.170
Mana!

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.210
Prez!

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:27.610
You mustn't.

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.430
Please escape.

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:29.740
But...

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.210
Don't worry.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:37.110
Let's believe in those girls.

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:38.930
I'll fight too!

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:39.900
Regina!

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.520
I want to settle the score myself!

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.570
Let's go, girls.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:50.460
This is our final battle!

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.860
Precure Love Link!

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:57.650
L-O-V-E!

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.400
L-O-V-E!

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.110
L-O-V-E!

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:00.300
L-O-V-E!

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.070
Precure Dress Up!

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:05.950
Kyupirappa!

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.250
Brimming with love,

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.450
Cure Heart!

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.680
The light of wisdom,

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:19.040
Cure Diamond!

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:22.870
The warmth of the sun,

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.330
Cure Rosetta!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.040
The blade of courage,

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.240
Cure Sword!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.890
Love's trump card,

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:36.250
Cure Ace!

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.700
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:42.820
Dokidoki Precure!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.010
{OP}

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:51.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:53.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.600
Every day it sparkles

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:02.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:09.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:14.840
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:20.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:25.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:31.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:40.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.180
Happy lucky Precure

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.220
What's more than just cute

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:54.090
is our promise between girls

00:03:54.890 --> 00:04:00.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:06.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:18.040
From Me to You! 

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:18.040
From Me to You! 

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.420
Rosetta Reflection!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.050
Girls, follow my lead!

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:55.540
I'll handle this!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.320
Holy Sword!

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.050
Thanks, Sword!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.100
Oh no you don't!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:14.900
Regina!

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.710
Rosetta! Sword!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.310
Twinkle Diamond!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.450
Ace Shot!

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.010
Bang!

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.910
Egogy!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.200
Girls, are you all right?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.570
Yeah, nothing serious.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.470
Just a scratch.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.200
It's too much!

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:50.700
I can't go on!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.050
You're down quick!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.670
Where'd that motivation go?

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.990
I was joking, silly.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:59.250
I'm with Mana, so I won't quit until it's all over!

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.490
Regina...

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.220
Let's go, girls.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:10.680
Precure Royal Lovely Straight Flush!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:21.190
Nice try!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.180
Begone!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.500
We're not safe here. We have to run!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.860
Run where?

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.160
Bro?

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:01.320
If those girls lose, the whole world'll be engulfed in darkness!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.710
So I'd rather see their fight through to the end!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.040
Then I'm stayin' too!

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.740
Don't die on me, Mana!

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.880
Rikka, hold on!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.090
Alice, you can't lose!

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:22.690
Makoto, stand up!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.390
Agwee, Wejeena, hold on!

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:28.750
Mana, stay strong!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.600
You're our only hope!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:34.800
If you give up, it's the end of the world!

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:36.860
Fear not.

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:40.780
Your friends and family will soon join you.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.250
The world... nay, the universe...

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:46.510
all belong to me!

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:49.450
Do you realize what you're saying?

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:55.790
If the world is yours alone, you <i>can</i> do whatever you want...

00:07:56.230 --> 00:08:00.310
but if you're all alone in the world,

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:04.000
you won't be able to cut in line or jaywalk.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:05.040
What?!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:09.890
Because what selfishness comes down to...

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:13.070
is bothering others with your actions.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.930
If there's nobody else in the world,

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.550
you can't truly be selfish! {:logic:}

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:19.450
Silence!

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.380
Silence, silence!

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.860
You dare lecture <i>me</i>?!

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.550
Cure Heart!

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.090
<i>You're</i> the selfish one!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:43.670
I'll tear out your insolent psyche myself!

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:48.810
Agonize before my strongest Egogy!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.530
You can't, Mana!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.050
Keep your heart strong!

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:02.290
Don't give him your psyche!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.310
Mana!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.200
Mana!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:06.660
Stooooooop!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.280
I've finally taken a Precure's psyche!

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:28.370
The entire world is now mine!

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:29.850
Mana!

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:32.080
Mana!

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.340
Mana! {#RIP}

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.060
Get back here! {un-#RIP}

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.280
Mana!

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:31.190
Mana!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.210
Sorry I worried you, girls.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.520
Looks like you wasted your time!

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:42.390
Even if we should lose our flesh and bones, our souls...

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:44.460
nay, our <i>love</i> is everlasting!

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:48.950
Please girls, lend me your strength.

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:51.640
Sure!

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:57.100
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.180
Mana!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.890
Cure Heart,

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.600
Parthenon Mode! {Now we're pulling from Greek architecture? Sure, last episode, do whatever.}

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.400
I won't be fooled!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.200
How fast!

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:40.500
She's nothing like the Cure Heart I fought before!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.480
Powerful emotions give people strength!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.970
Any girl with a powerful enough emotion to protect others...

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.750
can become a Precure!

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:58.420
And that power can rival even our universe's Big Bang! {fuckingstupid.jpg}

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:29.730
<i>There were those that opposed me ten thousand years ago as well...</i>

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:35.750
<i>A team of girls that always stood up no matter how often they were knocked down!</i>

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:38.130
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.770
<i>that history is repeating itself?!</i>

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:50.200
From me to you,

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.560
My Sweet Heart!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.790
Indeed, history repeats itself!

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:03.830
As long as humans possess selfish, egotistical hearts,

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.990
I will always return.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.670
Always, I tell you!

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.540
I know.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.770
Even I have a selfish heart.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.430
What?!

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:22.400
I've had times where I've been jealous or just wanted to run away. {Outside of the fact that you've been a goddamn saint for 49 episodes straight.}

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:26.650
But I think the pain and struggling that come with it...

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.880
can make people stronger.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:31.350
Loo—

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:35.430
And even if I lose sight of my love,

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.320
I have my friends!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.320
Loooo—

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.790
As long as I have friends by my side,

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:46.260
I'll always stand up and fight back!

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:55.340
Loove looove loooooooove!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.730
What happened to us?

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:15.740
I remember these monsters appearing...

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.500
We've been saved!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.270
Guess that wraps everything up!

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:30.010
But the princess will never return...

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:34.230
Trump Kingdom is finally at peace once again,

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.090
yet she'll never see it for herself!

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.370
Makoto...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.420
Look!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.570
Princess!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.290
Ange!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.290
Ann!

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:47.040
I'm sorry, Father, Jonathan.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:50.260
I can no longer return to my previous form.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:55.420
Both Regina and Aguri were filled with love,

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:58.060
causing them each to grow as individuals.

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:01.010
Don't worry!

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:03.770
I'll always be by Daddy's side!

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:07.850
I shall live to carry on your will!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.280
Thank you...

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.010
Jonathan...

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:11.740
Ann...

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.430
I'm happy.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:17.220
The love you gave me was more than I could ask for.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.190
I'm happy too, Ann.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:23.660
Cure Sword.

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.960
Princess!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:29.430
You've been in great pain because of me.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:35.840
But finding friends enabled you to resolve this conflict.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.540
You have my heartfelt gratitude.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.410
Your gratitude is fine, but...

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.880
all I ever wanted...

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.750
was to stay by your side!

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:47.440
Tears don't suit you.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:53.720
Smile and let the world listen to your beautiful voice.

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.710
I can't!

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:58.290
If the world doesn't have you in it...

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.940
how could I ever smile again?

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:02.900
Makopi!

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:10.220
Do not be sad, Sword.

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:12.280
Princess...

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.590
Didn't I tell you to call me Ann?

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:18.810
My life force now lies within Ai. {命の絆? The fuck?}

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.790
So I'll always be watching over you.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.500
Princess...

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.230
Thank you, everyone.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.330
I truly mean it.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.040
Makoto!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.430
Ai...

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:43.880
I love you!

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.820
Whoa, what're you—

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:52.890
Lemme go!

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:54.590
Look at you now.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.710
Pretty lame there, Bel.

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:57.930
It matters not.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:02.050
I'll just build more power over another ten thousand year slumber.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:05.300
What? <i>Another</i> ten thousand year nap?

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.110
Well...

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.770
those girls were still here. {I have no clue what this line is trying to actually say. Maybe reference the Precures of 10000 years ago? Noting how he'll still remember this batch of Cures? Probably nothing important. :V}

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.070
What're you doing?

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.680
We're leaving.

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:19.410
I know.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.630
I'm hungry.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.930
Go dig through garbage.

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:23.960
What?

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.130
<i>Shortly after that,</i>

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:31.020
<i>everyone started leading new lives.</i>

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.610
Good morning!

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:33.200
'Sup!

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:33.830
Good morning!

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.130
Morning!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.450
Morning, Jun!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.810
Used to student council work yet?

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:41.220
I'm still far behind you, Prez.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.260
Come on, aren't you the president now?

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.270
Sorry...

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.510
Hey, that ribbon is against the dress code!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.110
Dress code?

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:50.980
What's that?

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.010
It's a code that—

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.370
Morning, Mana!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:57.190
I had some trouble with my homework, so help me out!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.740
Hey, Regina!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.120
Need help with anything?

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.560
Charles!

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:03.520
If you insist...

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:04.520
King me.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.290
What?!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:10.490
<i>Regina's father retired from the throne.</i>

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.730
Chea's here!

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:13.210
Charles!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.330
Thank you.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:17.870
<i>Rikka's studying even harder.</i>

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.670
I don't want to regret not working hard enough!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:22.040
Hundred Poets

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:22.040
m 448 405 l 725 330 l 790 298 l 839 328 l 832 423 l 768 424 l 645 458 l 574 476 l 513 495 l 463 471

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:22.170
Hundred Poets

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:22.170
m 448 405 l 725 330 l 790 298 l 839 328 l 832 423 l 768 424 l 645 458 l 574 476 l 513 495 l 463 471

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.510
Hundred Poets

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.510
m 448 405 l 725 330 l 790 298 l 839 328 l 832 423 l 768 424 l 645 458 l 574 476 l 513 495 l 463 471

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.510
Then what's <i>this</i> for?

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.460
Wait!

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.940
Don't touch that!

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.610
Cooking Class

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:30.850
<i>Aguri started to get along with her classmates.</i>

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:31.800
Yummy!

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.250
You could serve this at a restaurant!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.770
Aguri, you could totally be a pastry chef!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.220
Oh, you're too kind...

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.320
You've gotta come over and teach me this!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:40.820
Me too!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:41.820
Me three!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:49.000
<i>We're connected to Trump Kingdom by the portal King Selfish opened.</i>

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.470
Everyone seems to be doing well.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.940
You seem pretty busy too, Joe.

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:59.760
Well, I <i>was</i> elected to be the inaugural President of the Trump Republic.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.810
The times have changed.

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:06.910
The kingdom Ann left has had much cultural exchange with the human world,

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.920
giving birth to a new country!

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:10.460
And just like that!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:17.160
So this is the kingdom's automated cleaner that Makoto spoke of.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.690
It's magnificent!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.670
May we purchase one million of them?

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.140
O-One million?!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:27.100
If you'd like, please sign this contract.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:27.970
C-Certainly!

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:33.940
<i>Makopi became a worldwide hit as a star from Trump Kingdom!</i>

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:37.920
I always thought it strange.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:43.390
Why do people in this world sing together so much?

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:47.090
Aren't songs supposed to be listened to in silence?

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:52.560
But since I met you, I've understood why.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.940
It's wonderful to do things together!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:03.360
Sing your heart out...

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:05.870
so your songs can touch theirs!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:07.140
I will!

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:10.350
Thank you, everyone!

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:11.950
This is the finale!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:15.420
Hello, Cure Heart speaking!

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.690
We have another request for you.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:23.060
A giant satellite has fallen out of orbit and is headed straight for Oogai City!

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:25.160
You're late!

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:26.700
Sorry!

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:31.180
I guess you're taking requests from everyone now, Mana.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.940
I suppose you can't help it.

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:35.340
You're a Happy Prince, after all.

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.400
Girls, let's go!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.240
Charles!

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:42.480
Okay!

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:46.150
Precure Love Link!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.450
Precure Dress Up!

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:56.350
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
Dokidoki Precure!
